{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35174","headline":"题东林寺虎掊泉 · 周繇","name":"题东林寺虎掊泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胜致通幽感，灵泉有虎掊。\n爪擡山脉断，掌托石心抝。\n竹蔼疑相近，松阴盖亦交。\n转令栖遁者，真境逾难抛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周繇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}